      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>Solé – Home</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n\n    <header>\n      <h1>Solé</h1>\n      <nav>\n        <a href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\n        <a href=\"music.html\">Music</a>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <main>\n\n      <section id=\"hero\">\n        <h2>Independent Artist. Oakland, CA.</h2>\n        <p>\n          Blending Afrobeats, R&B, and spoken word into music that moves\n          both body and mind.\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"music.html\">Explore the music</a>\n      </section>\n\n      <section id=\"about\">\n        <h2>About</h2>\n        <p>\n          Solé grew up between Lagos and Oakland, and you can hear both in\n          every track she makes. Her debut EP <em>Roots & Static</em> was\n          recorded entirely in her bedroom studio and released independently\n          in 2024.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          When she's not in the studio, Solé runs free music production\n          workshops for teens in her neighborhood through her project,\n          The Static Room.\n        </p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section id=\"featured\">\n        <h2>Latest Release</h2>\n        <h3>Roots & Static – EP</h3>\n        <p>Four tracks. No features. All feeling.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Golden Hour</li>\n          <li>No Signal</li>\n          <li>Carry On</li>\n          <li>Static Love</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"music.html\">See full discography</a>\n      </section>\n\n      <section id=\"shows\">\n        <h2>Upcoming Shows</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>July 12 – The New Parish, Oakland CA</li>\n          <li>July 26 – Café du Nord, San Francisco CA</li>\n          <li>August 3 – Lodge Room, Los Angeles CA</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p><a href=\"#\">Get tickets</a></p>\n      </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n      <p>\n        <a href=\"#\">Instagram</a>\n        <a href=\"#\">SoundCloud</a>\n        <a href=\"#\">Email</a>\n      </p>\n      <p>&copy; 2025 Solé. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </footer>\n\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "music.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>Solé – Music</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n\n    <header>\n      <h1>Solé</h1>\n      <nav>\n        <a href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\n        <a href=\"music.html\">Music</a>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <main>\n\n      <section id=\"discography\">\n        <h2>Discography</h2>\n\n        <article>\n          <h3>Roots & Static</h3>\n          <p><strong>EP – 2024</strong></p>\n          <p>\n            Recorded over six months in a converted closet, <em>Roots & Static</em>\n            is about finding signal in the noise — figuring out who you are\n            when everything around you is pulling in different directions.\n          </p>\n          <h4>Tracklist</h4>\n          <ol>\n            <li>Golden Hour</li>\n            <li>No Signal</li>\n            <li>Carry On</li>\n            <li>Static Love</li>\n          </ol>\n        </article>\n\n        <article>\n          <h3>Drift</h3>\n          <p><strong>Single – 2023</strong></p>\n          <p>\n            A lo-fi R&B track about distance — physical and emotional.\n            <em>Drift</em> was Solé's first self-produced release and racked\n            up over 200K streams in its first month.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article>\n          <h3>Homecoming</h3>\n          <p><strong>Single – 2022</strong></p>\n          <p>\n            Written on a flight back from Lagos, <em>Homecoming</em> explores\n            what it means to belong somewhere — and what it costs to leave.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n      </section>\n\n      <section id=\"contact\">\n        <h2>Booking & Press</h2>\n        <p>For inquiries, reach out at <a href=\"mailto:booking@solemusic.com\">booking@solemusic.com</a></p>\n      </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n      <p>\n        <a href=\"#\">Instagram</a>\n        <a href=\"#\">SoundCloud</a>\n        <a href=\"#\">Email</a>\n      </p>\n      <p>&copy; 2025 Solé. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </footer>\n\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "5": {
          "id": "5",
          "name": "prompt.md",
          "contents": "1. What is the goal?\nWhat should your website look and feel like after styling? What mood or tone should it communicate?\n\nAnswer:\n\n---\n\n2. What are the constraints?\n- What brand colors and fonts must be used?\n- Which sections must be styled consistently (header, nav, main content, footer)?\n- Are there any readability or usability requirements?\n\nAnswer:\n\n---\n\n3. What are the edge cases?\nWhat styling problems should be avoided? For example: low contrast text, hard-to-read fonts, inconsistent spacing, etc.\n\nAnswer:\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "5"
      ]
    },
